mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7999762.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Strategic Planning Senior Manager role is to&amp;nbsp;bridge cultural trends and business objectives into actionable brand strategies and creative briefs, leading cross-functional teams and mentoring junior planners to drive accelerated growth and creative impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crack Culture into Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Decode trends, behaviors, and platforms to build actionable strategies that fuel brand relevance in culture, especially across social and influencer ecosystems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Brief to Brilliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Lead campaign thinking from insight to idea—write strategic briefs that spark bold creativity and guide cross-functional teams to execute with clarity, speed, and cohesion.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Strategists, Activate Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mentor junior planners, manage multi-stream planning projects, and translate business objectives into strategic blueprints that accelerate growth and creative impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recognized University Degree&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Thinker: Strategic x Creative: &lt;/strong&gt;5–8 years of experience in brand strategy, social/influencer strategy, or content planning. Must be fluent in culture, brand, and comms thinking—with a proven knack for making the complex simple and the simple powerful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Hacker &amp;amp; Deck Ninja: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional storytelling—both in presentations and planning narratives. Can turn a business task into a breakthrough content territory, faster than a trending meme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People-first, Purpose-fueled: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong leadership and collaboration mindset. Energizes teams, influences stakeholders, and keeps strategy relevant, inspiring, and outcome-driven—even under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone excited about Marketing Technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a good command of English and strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player, highly motivated, and committed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to coach and develop junior members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has depth of understanding about the industry, business, brands, and consumers in client conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for data, insights, and ideation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Values integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Paid Leave &amp;amp; Sick Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marriage, Medical, and Compassionate Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance &amp;amp; Private healthcare plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly, Quarterly, Annual MVP Awards (prizes up to 8,000USD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allowances (Parking Fees, Birthday, TGIF)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacBook to be provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good chance to explore new trends in the digital market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn and work with the most advanced advertising technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a professional, active, international, and dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;A&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(53, 152, 219);&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(132, 63, 161);&quot;&gt;v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(185, 106, 217);&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(186, 55, 42);&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;d&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 145, 121);&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt; tools for all positions&lt;/li&gt;
