&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;This is your calling for Pediatric Home Care!&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Phoenix Skilled Office is seeking a compassionate and dedicated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;426&quot;&gt;Registered Nurse (RN)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Skilled Nursing team in a pediatric private duty role. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care- delivered with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;588&quot; data-end=&quot;631&quot;&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;Meet &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;Our Clients:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We currently have open overnight shifts caring for both pediatric and adult clients throughout the Phoenix metro.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Immediate overnight shifts available&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;Starting pay:&lt;/strong&gt; $35–$43 per hour &lt;em data-start=&quot;1183&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;(client-specific)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All BAYADA Skilled Nurses Enjoy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly paychecks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedules that work for you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one client care&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preventive care covered for ALL employees (PRN included)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$1,200 nurse referral bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Choose our Phoenix BAYADA Office?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Supportive, team-focused culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1588&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;Our Phoenix office is a close-knit team known for hands-on support, open communication, and a strong sense of community—where nurses feel valued and never alone in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;Flexible schedules with meaningful impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Enjoy the autonomy to create a schedule that works for you while providing individualized care that truly makes a difference in a child’s life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;You take care of others, BAYADA takes care of you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits for full-time employees include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, vision, prescription coverage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO (paid vacation or sick leave)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid holidays, vacation, and sick leave* &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match*&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life insurance* &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Eligibility requirements apply&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes private duty nursing different than home health visits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traditional shifts (4’s, 8’s, 10’s or 12’s)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on care with only one client per day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building client relationships and watching their milestones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your day looks like at BAYADA:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to &lt;strong&gt;one&lt;/strong&gt; client’s home near you on a schedule you choose&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with, execute, and properly document doctors&#39; orders &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform assessments and monitor clients&#39; conditions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document observations, interventions, and evaluations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feel empowered to perform skills with autonomy in the home&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Proud to be Recognized As:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Greatest Workplace for: Overall, Women, Parents &amp;amp; Families, Diversity &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forbes Best Employers for Veterans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for a private duty RN:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation from an accredited and approved nursing program, as indicated by school transcript or diploma &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A current nursing license in good standing in the state of Arizona&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One year of experience working as a Registered Nurse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trach experience preferred, but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SER-AZ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is celebrating 50 years of compassion, excellence, and reliability. Learn more about our 50th anniversary celebration and how you can join in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/50&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care, Inc., and its associated entities and joint venture partners, are Equal Opportunity Employers. All employment decisions are made on a non-discriminatory basis without regard to sex, race, color, age, disability, pregnancy or maternity, sexual orientation, gender identity, citizenship status, military status, or any other similarly protected status in accordance with federal, state and local laws. &amp;nbsp;Hence, we strongly encourage applications from people with these identities or who are members of other marginalized communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

